{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:763","content":{"id":763,"title":"发布","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"项目内置了一套博客模板，支持将卡片、文章、项目和知识库直接按照模板生成网页，生成的网页可以直接发布，可通过 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://lastknightcoder.github.io","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Tau's Blog"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 查看发布的博客样式，博客风格是极简风，简单克制。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_27efdfaf-33f3-4a31-bc86-4365ea01352d.webp","uuid":"574f2638-9c11-4a33-9e14-3b3ee0b60688","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_27efdfaf-33f3-4a31-bc86-4365ea01352d.webp","width":720,"description":"首页渲染"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17f0bcf4-8deb-4fe2-84b1-5bc79d26163f.webp","uuid":"c1dfde7d-05e4-4578-9967-8de8e62221a2","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_17f0bcf4-8deb-4fe2-84b1-5bc79d26163f.webp","width":720,"description":"卡片渲染"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f8b17df4-e0a2-4835-a366-5c582a2f61b7.webp","uuid":"fbc0e3d1-f514-4c88-a882-42b01cf55cf5","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f8b17df4-e0a2-4835-a366-5c582a2f61b7.webp","width":720,"description":"文章渲染"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_216cfbcf-dc2c-4e72-9451-a1ea4ee81646.webp","uuid":"991e33f7-f0a6-43ed-977e-5322dc4d7c56","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_216cfbcf-dc2c-4e72-9451-a1ea4ee81646.webp","width":720,"description":"知识库和项目的渲染"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持三种发布方式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_91cab6ed-ab06-430a-b2da-4c451113cad9.webp","uuid":"6e7acda0-4abd-4b30-b5b6-1e9291e95480","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_91cab6ed-ab06-430a-b2da-4c451113cad9.webp","width":720},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Github Pages：可以直接将构建参数直接推送到指定分支，比如推送到 gh-pages 上，就可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"github.io","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 域名进行访问了"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要先在集成设置中先配置好 Github Token，否则没有访问权限"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了保证推送成功，推送是通过 force 的方式推送的，有可能丢失 commit 记录，如果介意的话可以通过本地导出，然后自行推送"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"S3：推送到支持 S3 协议的服务器上，比如阿里的 OSS，腾讯的 COS，或者 AWS 的 S3，然后在各自的云服务商进行配置来提供 Web 服务"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地导出：如果以上无法满足你的部署需求，可以直接将构建产物导出到本地的一个文件夹中，然后自行部署构建产物"}]}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"blue","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑到可能将部署产物部署在非根路径下，在这种情况下需要配置访问路径，默认是根路径，如果不匹配，则页面无法获取到相应的资源文件，也就无法渲染出来"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_97311423-f2cb-473b-b0ba-fc8e1036b14a.webp","uuid":"f7711e79-e4bb-4462-a099-75771c6f9878","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_97311423-f2cb-473b-b0ba-fc8e1036b14a.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 Github Pages，会根据仓库名称自动生成访问路径，不用手动进行配置。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"发布","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:763","type":"doc","id":763}}],"prevPage":{"title":"资源存储","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:772","type":"doc","id":772}},"nextPage":{"title":"导出","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:767","type":"doc","id":767}},"createTime":1766915941580,"updateTime":1777706672223,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777706672223}}